          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot okobo ni, “Jo ame olonyere kengi me wot i potti, kun lubo dano acel ame tye i dyere, ame camo riŋo puno kede gigi mogo me kwer kede oyoo, gin luŋ obino tum karacel awaŋe acel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pien an aŋeo ticgi kede tamgi, an abino bino me coko rok luŋ ame kobo leb apapat karacel; gin bino bino te bino neno kwogona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an abino keto anyut i akinagi. Iyi akinagi kannono, abino cwayo jo ame obwot baŋ orok, baŋ Tarcic, Put kede Lud, ame gin jo ame wao akud atero, baŋ Tubal kede Javan, baŋ lobo ame tye i dog nam kannabor, ame mom ru owinyo kite a nyiŋa orwo kede, akadi neno kwogona; gin bino rabo pi kwogona i akina orok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin bino kelo omegowu i akina rok luŋ acalo mot me yalo Rwot, kun okelogi aguragura, gadigadi, alago, kanne kede inaga, naka i kidina acil ame tye i Jerucalem, kite ame jo Icrael kela kede motgi me moko kwon i tabo acil, i ot a Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok jo ocele i akinagi abino kwanyo me bedo olamdog kede jo Levi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
